    "lineage": "",
    "mech_note": "Stacked item-granted auras (Dream helm/shield → Holy Shock, Dragon armor → Holy Fire) pulse passive lightning/fire damage around the moving body while Zeal delivers physical swings; gear defines the entire offensive identity — the character is a walking aura battery. Low skill-point investment; aura damage ignores most immunities via Holy Shock's lightning. A PvE hybrid that was never a ladder-viable primary until 2.4 removed resistance immunities and the item economy became more accessible. The Dream runeword (Jah Pul Mal) aura stacks with itself if worn in both helm and shield slots, creating double Holy Shock pulses. Movement never stops the aura; this is a walk-and-pulse kit that delegates damage to the gear layer.",
